Overall Activity

The activity is associated with GruntHTTP.exe, which performed an LDAP-based discovery request to collect information related to the theshire.local domain environment.

The connection was made from 172.18.39.5 to 172.18.38.5 over TCP port 389, which is used for LDAP communication. This activity can allow an attacker to gather information about the domain environment and related directory services.
